<title>NETHERLANDS: Nagron details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Nagron details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch real estate company Nagron Nationaal Grondbezit NV said on Tuesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 32 held.</p>
<p>In April, Nagron announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 6.15 guilders, up from 5.30 guilders in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Nagron shares closed at 204.50 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
